# Close agent-opened browser surfaces

Close every agent-opened browser surface when its job slice ends; never close owner-created surfaces.

- Agent-opened: tabs, windows, debug profiles, CDP/WebBridge, Cursor browser used for probes, setup, screenshots, or tests.
- Same turn as Pass / Fail / Blocked: close those surfaces via the **specific** window or profile.
- Never kill all browser processes. Never close the owner's personal tabs or profile.
- Owner already-open tabs may be used when that is the fastest safe route — still leave them alone at cleanup; only close what the agent created.

Gate: `assertAgentBrowserCleanup` in `src/lib/agent-browser-cleanup.ts`.

